785715200000) and a high zone near 1954-1959 (1784678400000, 1785024000000).", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1803.74", "start_time_ms": 1784160000000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike: three bars from 1916.51 to a 2771.00 high, with closes at 2252.16, 2326.32 and 2515.30; the spike left the 34-bar range ceiling of 1974.46 far behind and has not been fully retraced.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range: 28 two-sided, overlapping bars between the 2357.18 low (1788307200000) and the 2771.00 spike high (1787270400000); subsequent highs are lower (2680.00 at 1789084800000, 2643.52 at 1789689600000) and the range floor near 2357 was defended twice, so this is a breakout-mode range rather than a measured channel.", "end_time_ms": 1789775999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787270400000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Double bottom at the base of the post-spike range: lows of 2357.18 (1788307200000) and 2358.62 (1789430400000), each followed by a bull close (2391.94 and 2397.10).", "end_time_ms": 1789516799999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1788307200000, "upper_boundary": null}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["A close above 2680.00 and then above 2771.00 with follow-through on the next bar would confirm a range breakout and reassert the bull trend.", "A close below 2357.18 would break the twice-tested post-spike floor and shift the read toward a range breakdown / possible top after the spike.", "Continued overlapping bars between 2357.18 and 2680.00 keep the range phase and low Always-In relevance.", "Immediate failure of the current bull bar, e.g. a bear bar closing back below 2397.10 (the 1789430400000 close), would reinforce two-sided range trading and